@startuml Cart_Order_Flow_Complete
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 300
skinparam noteFontSize 11
skinparam participantPadding 20

title **Plattr - Cart, Pricing & Order Flow**\n(Onboarding Reference for New Developers)

' ============================================================
'  PARTICIPANTS
' ============================================================
actor "Customer App" as Client #LightBlue
participant "addItemToCart" as AddItem #LightGreen
participant "calculateItemPrice" as CalcItem #LightYellow
participant "calculateCartValue" as CalcCart #LightYellow
participant "checkoutCart" as Checkout #Orange
participant "validateCart" as Validate #PeachPuff
participant "createOrUpdateOrder" as OrderService #Salmon
database "Firestore" as DB #LightGray
participant "orderTriggers" as Triggers #Plum
participant "sendFCMNotification" as FCM #Pink
actor "Server/Waiter App" as ServerApp #LightCoral

' ============================================================
'  SECTION 1: ADD ITEM TO CART
' ============================================================
== **Phase 1: Add Item to Cart** ==

Client -> AddItem: addItemToCart(\n  restaurantId, tableId, menuItemId,\n  quantity, selectedVariants, selectedAddons,\n  sessionId)

note right of AddItem #LightCyan
  **Feature Flag Check**
  ""fallbackToSameCustomConfigurationForAddItem""
  If enabled AND item already in cart:
    → Inherit existing item's variants/addons
end note

AddItem -> DB: Fetch menuItem doc
DB --> AddItem: menuItem { priceInfo, variants[], addons[] }

AddItem -> DB: Fetch variant & addon docs (parallel)
DB --> AddItem: Variant details, Addon details

note right of AddItem #Wheat
  **Variant & Addon Processing**
  • Validate mandatory variants selected
  • Extract priceInfo for each
  • Check ""respectParentDiscount"" flag
end note

AddItem -> CalcItem: calculateItemPrice(\n  menuItem, selectedVariants, selectedAddons)

note over CalcItem #LightYellow
  **Price Calculation Logic**
  ─────────────────────────────
  1. **Item Base**: menuItem.priceInfo.basePrice
  2. **Item Discount**: menuItem.priceInfo.discount (%)
  3. **Item Final**: basePrice * (1 - discount/100)

  **For Each Variant/Addon:**
  IF respectParentDiscount == true:
    → variantFinal = variantBase * (1 - **itemDiscount**/100)
  ELSE:
    → variantFinal = variant's own finalPrice

  **Totals:**
  totalBase = itemBase + Σ(variantBase) + Σ(addonBase)
  totalFinal = itemFinal + Σ(variantFinal) + Σ(addonFinal)
  discountAmount = totalBase - totalFinal
end note

CalcItem --> AddItem: { priceInfo: CartItemPriceInfo }

note right of AddItem #LightCyan
  **Feature Flag Check**
  ""isMultipleVariantOrAddonForMenuItemsSupported""
  If **false**:
    → Cannot add same item with different config
    → Returns error with existing item details
end note

AddItem -> AddItem: findIdenticalItemInCart()
alt Identical item exists
  AddItem -> AddItem: existingItem.quantity += quantity
  AddItem -> AddItem: Recalculate priceInfo for new quantity
else New item
  AddItem -> AddItem: cart.items.push(newItem)
end

AddItem -> CalcCart: calculateCartValue(cart)

note over CalcCart #LightYellow
  **Cart Total Calculation**
  ───────────────────────────
  Loop through all items (skip cancelled):
  • Accumulate: basePrice, finalPrice
  • Accumulate: totalVariantBasePrice
  • Accumulate: totalAddonBasePrice

  **Cart Discount:**
  totalDiscountAmount = basePrice - finalPrice
  totalDiscount (%) = (discountAmount / basePrice) * 100
end note

CalcCart --> AddItem: CartTotalPriceInfo

AddItem -> DB: **Transaction**: Set cart doc with\n  items[], priceInfo, sessionId, lastUpdated
DB --> AddItem: Success

AddItem --> Client: { status: "success", cart: {...} }

' ============================================================
'  SECTION 2: CHECKOUT FLOW
' ============================================================
== **Phase 2: Checkout Cart** ==

Client -> Checkout: checkoutCart(\n  restaurantId, tableId, sessionId, notes)

Checkout -> DB: Validate session exists & is active
DB --> Checkout: Session valid ✓

Checkout -> DB: Fetch cart doc
DB --> Checkout: cart { items[], priceInfo }

alt Cart empty or not found
  Checkout --> Client: ERROR: "No active cart found"
end

Checkout -> Validate: validateCart(cart)

note over Validate #PeachPuff
  **Validation Checks**
  ───────────────────────
  For each item:
  1. itemFinal ≈ (itemBase + variantBase + addonBase) * (1 - discount%)
  2. totalBase ≈ itemBase * quantity
  3. finalPrice ≈ itemFinal * quantity

  For cart totals:
  4. cart.basePrice ≈ Σ(item.totalBasePrice)
  5. cart.finalPrice ≈ Σ(item.finalPrice)

  **Tolerance**: 0.01 (for floating point)
end note

alt Validation FAILS
  note right of Checkout #Tomato
    **⚠️ Known Issue**
    Prices are recalculated in-memory
    but NOT saved back to Firestore.
    If order creation fails later,
    cart remains with stale data.
  end note
  Checkout -> CalcCart: Recalculate prices (in-memory only)
  CalcCart --> Checkout: Fixed priceInfo
end

Checkout -> DB: validateMenuItemsStock(items)
DB --> Checkout: stockStatus[]

alt Any item out of stock
  Checkout --> Client: ERROR: "Items out of stock: [names]"
end

note right of Checkout #Khaki
  **⚠️ Race Condition (Tech Debt)**
  Stock check happens BEFORE transaction.
  Item could go out of stock between
  validation and order write.
end note

Checkout -> OrderService: createOrUpdateOrder(\n  restaurantId, tableId, cart,\n  userId, notes, sessionId)

' ============================================================
'  SECTION 3: ORDER CREATION
' ============================================================
== **Phase 3: Create/Update Order** ==

OrderService -> DB: **Transaction Start**\nQuery orders where tableId == X\nAND status IN (PENDING, IN_PROGRESS)

alt Existing active order found
  note over OrderService #LightGreen
    **Append Cart to Order**
    • order.carts.push(cartSnapshot)
    • order.items.push(...normalizedItems)
    • Recalculate total priceInfo
    • Concatenate notes
  end note
  OrderService -> DB: Update order doc
else No active order
  note over OrderService #LightGreen
    **Create New Order**
    • Generate orderNumber (ORD-00001)
    • Initialize carts: [cartSnapshot]
    • Set orderStatus: IN_PROGRESS
    • Set paymentStatus: UNPAID
  end note
  OrderService -> DB: Create new order doc
end

OrderService -> DB: **Transaction End**
DB --> OrderService: order { id, orderNumber, ... }

OrderService --> Checkout: order

Checkout -> DB: clearCartInternal(restaurantId, tableId)
note right of Checkout #Tomato
  **⚠️ Potential Duplicate Order**
  If clearCart fails but order was created,
  user sees success but cart is still full.
  Re-checkout = duplicate order!
end note

Checkout --> Client: { orderId, orderNumber, status: IN_PROGRESS }

' ============================================================
'  SECTION 4: TRIGGERS & NOTIFICATIONS
' ============================================================
== **Phase 4: Firestore Triggers & Notifications** ==

DB -[#blue]> Triggers: ""onOrderPlaced"" (order doc created)

note over Triggers #Plum
  **Feature Flag Check**
  ""sendServerNotifications""
  If disabled → skip all notifications
end note

Triggers -> DB: Fetch table doc (get serverId)
DB --> Triggers: table { serverId? }

alt No serverId assigned
  note over Triggers #LightGreen
    **Auto-Assign Server**
    Query servers where status == 'active'
    Pick first available
    Update table.serverId
    Update server.assignedTables[]
  end note
  Triggers -> DB: Update table & server
end

Triggers -> DB: Fetch server doc (get FCM token)
DB --> Triggers: server { fcmToken, ... }

alt FCM token exists
  Triggers -> FCM: Send notification\n  title: "New Order Placed"\n  body: "Table X: [Item Names]"
  FCM -> ServerApp: Push Notification 📱
end

...Later, kitchen marks cart as READY...

DB -[#blue]> Triggers: ""onOrderUpdated""\n(cart.status changed to READY)

Triggers -> DB: Fetch table & server (same logic)
Triggers -> FCM: Send notification\n  title: "Order Ready"\n  body: "Table X Ready: [Item Names]"
FCM -> ServerApp: Push Notification 📱

@enduml
